  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "How do I reset Tradovate 2FA if I lost my phone?", a: "If you saved a backup method, use it to log in. If you didn't, contact Tradovate support at support@tradovate.com or 1-844-283-3100, verify your identity, and ask them to reset your two-factor authentication so you can sign in and re-enroll." },
